{
  "format": "sparkbench-project",
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "555 blinker with speed control",
    "created": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modified": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
    "appVersion": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Press Run, then drag the wiper of RV1 while it plays: up = faster, down = slower. RV1 (100 kΩ, wired as a variable resistor) plus R2 = 10 kΩ sets the timing: f = 1.44 / ((R1 + 2·(R2 + RV)) · C), from ≈ 0.65 Hz (wiper at the bottom) to ≈ 6.9 Hz (top); ≈ 1.2 Hz at 50 %."
  },
